     Patch2 consists primarily of context diffs, which require that the
file being modified match the one those diffs were cut from.  This means
that you not only need 3.1.1 to start with, but you should also undo any
local modifications (which can then be redone after applying the patch).

     Patch1 is available from comp.sources.games archive sites, and I
see it in usenet/comp.sources.games/volume16/nethack31/patch1*.Z at
ftp.uu.net (patch2 isn't there yet, or at least not in that directory).

